From: OpenDarwin bootstrap <opendarwin@example.com>
Subject: [PATCH] config: drop exports not generated by OSS iig-tools

The OSS iig-tools implementation ("iig-lite") generates the kernel-side
RPC glue for the DriverKit classes, but it does not generate every symbol
Apple's internal IIG emits.  In particular it does not emit:

  * the deprecated no-argument constructors (C1Ev/C2Ev) of the
    IODispatchSource subclasses (it only emits the metaclass-tagged
    constructor),
  * the !KERNEL-only `Create_Call' send-side entry points, and
  * the generated OSAction_<Class>_<Action> subclasses (for example
    OSAction_IOUserClient_KernelCompletion), including their metaclass
    globals and vtable.

Because `-Wl,-exported_symbols_list' treats every listed symbol as an
undefined root, the kernel link then fails with `symbol(s) not found'
for exactly these entries.  They describe no object present in the OSS
build, so remove them from the export lists.

--- a/config/IOKit.exports
+++ b/config/IOKit.exports
@@ -1303,9 +1303,7 @@
 __ZN25IODataQueueDispatchSource9_DispatchEPS_5IORPC
 __ZN25IODataQueueDispatchSource9metaClassE
 __ZN25IODataQueueDispatchSourceC1EPK11OSMetaClass
-__ZN25IODataQueueDispatchSourceC1Ev
 __ZN25IODataQueueDispatchSourceC2EPK11OSMetaClass
-__ZN25IODataQueueDispatchSourceC2Ev
 __ZN25IODataQueueDispatchSourceD0Ev
 __ZN25IODataQueueDispatchSourceD1Ev
 __ZN25IODataQueueDispatchSourceD2Ev
--- a/config/Private.exports
+++ b/config/Private.exports
@@ -156,7 +156,6 @@
 __ZN35IOServiceNotificationDispatchSource10SetHandlerEP8OSActionPFiP15OSMetaClassBase5IORPCE
 __ZN35IOServiceNotificationDispatchSource10gMetaClassE
 __ZN35IOServiceNotificationDispatchSource11Cancel_ImplEU13block_pointerFvvE
-__ZN35IOServiceNotificationDispatchSource11Create_CallEP12OSDictionaryyP15IODispatchQueuePPS_
 __ZN35IOServiceNotificationDispatchSource11Create_ImplEP12OSDictionaryyP15IODispatchQueuePPS_
 __ZN35IOServiceNotificationDispatchSource13Create_InvokeE5IORPCPFiP12OSDictionaryyP15IODispatchQueuePPS_E
 __ZN35IOServiceNotificationDispatchSource15SetHandler_ImplEP8OSAction
@@ -177,9 +176,7 @@
 __ZN35IOServiceNotificationDispatchSource9_DispatchEPS_5IORPC
 __ZN35IOServiceNotificationDispatchSource9metaClassE
 __ZN35IOServiceNotificationDispatchSourceC1EPK11OSMetaClass
-__ZN35IOServiceNotificationDispatchSourceC1Ev
 __ZN35IOServiceNotificationDispatchSourceC2EPK11OSMetaClass
-__ZN35IOServiceNotificationDispatchSourceC2Ev
 __ZN35IOServiceNotificationDispatchSourceD0Ev
 __ZN35IOServiceNotificationDispatchSourceD1Ev
 __ZN35IOServiceNotificationDispatchSourceD2Ev
@@ -205,9 +202,6 @@
 __ZTV16IOUserClient2022
 __ZTVN16IOUserClient20229MetaClassE
 
-__ZN38OSAction_IOUserClient_KernelCompletion10gMetaClassE
-__ZN38OSAction_IOUserClient_KernelCompletion10superClassE
-__ZTV38OSAction_IOUserClient_KernelCompletion
